pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 신청기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. 학생 신청 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 11. 26(월) ~ 11. 29(목) [4일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 지도교수 확인 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 11. 26(월) ~ 12. 02(일) [7일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 주임교수 승인 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 12. 03(월) ~ 12. 05(수) [3일간]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p styl